<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - CVS Corp started.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - CVS Corp started.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Smith Barney analyst Gary Giblen said Tuesday he had started coverage of CVS Corp with a rating of underperform.</p>
<p>-- He set a 12-month price target of $43.</p>
<p>-- He set an estimate of earnings per share for 1997 of $1.98 and $2.38 for 1998.</p>
<p>-- Shares in the company opened down 1-1/2 at 48-5/8.</p>
<p>((-- Wall Street desk (212) 859-1730))</p>
</text>
